WEBVTT

01:26.070 --> 01:31.590
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.560
[Episode 12 The Mastermind]

02:06.470 --> 02:08.046
Don't lose it again.

02:08.070 --> 02:09.560
How did you get it?

02:09.670 --> 02:11.280
You went to see Qi Tianfeng?

02:43.490 --> 02:44.636
Mr. Yun.

02:44.660 --> 02:46.810
Qi Tianfeng visited Mr. Mo again this morning.

02:48.210 --> 02:50.730
[Guanghui Bank]

02:52.100 --> 02:53.700
The January Letter?

02:54.219 --> 02:56.430
It's the real work of Wang Xizhi.

03:01.090 --> 03:03.206
This coral is so beautiful.

03:03.230 --> 03:05.200
I bet it's a tribute to the royal family.

03:05.750 --> 03:07.126
This...

03:07.150 --> 03:09.390
Qi, what is this one called?

03:09.610 --> 03:11.400
The Cauldron of God Gu.

03:14.630 --> 03:16.470
It reminds me of an old friend.

03:17.740 --> 03:21.526
I remember seeing this cauldron at Wen Cong's house

03:21.550 --> 03:24.790
when he feted the merchants in Nandu.

03:25.090 --> 03:26.376
Yeah.

03:26.400 --> 03:28.826
He later gave it to the Chamber of Commerce for auction.

03:28.850 --> 03:30.700
It cost me a fortune

03:30.930 --> 03:32.880
to buy it.

03:33.640 --> 03:35.090
Qi.

03:35.280 --> 03:37.760
These are all precious treasures.

03:38.020 --> 03:41.356
If any government official catches me owning one of them,

03:41.380 --> 03:43.850
my whole family will be beheaded.

03:43.990 --> 03:45.896
Now you're giving them to me as gifts.

03:45.920 --> 03:47.445
I have to doubt your motives.

03:47.469 --> 03:49.250
Don't get me wrong.

03:49.520 --> 03:52.680
You can make fortunes by selling any of these things

03:53.080 --> 03:55.020
on the black market.

03:57.290 --> 03:58.740
Qi,

03:59.250 --> 04:01.190
we are both businessmen.

04:01.410 --> 04:03.480
So save me your little trick.

04:03.910 --> 04:05.360
Tell me.

04:05.910 --> 04:07.960
What brought you here?

04:08.620 --> 04:10.070
Just speak your mind.

04:12.990 --> 04:14.470
You're well-informed

04:14.470 --> 04:16.640
of what's going on in the market.

04:16.950 --> 04:18.559
So you should know

04:19.000 --> 04:21.270
that the raw silk of the Su family has entered the city.

04:21.469 --> 04:23.310
I lost everything

04:24.270 --> 04:27.670
in this big gamble.

04:28.710 --> 04:30.160
I've heard about it.

04:30.350 --> 04:32.670
So I have no choice

04:33.470 --> 04:35.630
but to give you these treasures

04:36.230 --> 04:38.196
in exchange for something else.

04:38.220 --> 04:39.670
What is it?

04:40.990 --> 04:43.470
All the assets of the Cao Sect

04:43.490 --> 04:45.036
are in Guanghui Bank.

04:45.060 --> 04:47.860
If you take them back,

04:47.990 --> 04:50.790
you'll have to

04:50.790 --> 04:52.960
reorganize everything

04:53.799 --> 04:56.246
and may not be able to

04:56.270 --> 04:58.430
earn as much as we do now.

05:00.470 --> 05:04.850
So I have a suggestion.

05:05.820 --> 05:09.180
Why don't we make a new deal?

05:14.670 --> 05:16.120
Mr. Mo,

05:16.560 --> 05:17.776
if you can lend me some money

05:17.800 --> 05:19.506
to help me pay off the debt,

05:19.530 --> 05:21.886
I promise to cut you in for 30%

05:21.910 --> 05:23.750
on the profits the Cao Sect earns

05:24.550 --> 05:26.150
from today onwards.

05:29.790 --> 05:31.240
Mr. Mo.

05:32.110 --> 05:33.446
50-50!

05:33.470 --> 05:34.846
In that way, you can get all your money back

05:34.870 --> 05:36.986
in less than three years.

05:37.010 --> 05:39.396
After that, you can sit it out and have a share

05:39.420 --> 05:41.630
of every dime we make.

05:49.799 --> 05:51.249
Qi Tianfeng,

05:52.940 --> 05:56.400
you don't seem to know the score here.

05:56.760 --> 05:59.076
All the assets of the Cao Sect

05:59.100 --> 06:00.556
are in my hands now.

06:00.580 --> 06:02.176
I can even say your life

06:02.200 --> 06:03.846
is mine too.

06:03.870 --> 06:05.350
In other words,

06:05.420 --> 06:09.186
every penny I let you keep is a reward.

06:09.210 --> 06:11.216
How could you call this a deal?

06:11.240 --> 06:12.970
I advise you

06:13.300 --> 06:15.040
not to burn your bridges.

06:15.110 --> 06:17.110
Don't burn your bridges.

06:19.350 --> 06:20.246
Isn't that something

06:20.270 --> 06:22.440
Mr. Wen once said to you too?

06:26.470 --> 06:29.140
Have you ever considered cutting him some slack?

06:35.190 --> 06:37.710
I am where I am today

06:38.910 --> 06:43.230
because I never believe in fate!

07:02.710 --> 07:04.230
Sit down and have some tea.

07:14.990 --> 07:15.926
It's exciting.

07:15.950 --> 07:17.470
Why don't you watch it with me?

07:31.030 --> 07:32.670
Once this matter is over,

07:32.820 --> 07:34.689
we'll be even, right?

07:35.030 --> 07:36.936
Not even close.

07:36.960 --> 07:39.180
You still need to find the orphans in Jishan Hall.

07:39.220 --> 07:40.950
I know. I'll get it done.

07:41.230 --> 07:42.525
Tell me.

07:42.549 --> 07:44.806
You caused quite a stir.

07:44.830 --> 07:46.710
What's in it for you?

07:46.790 --> 07:47.846
Besides,

07:47.870 --> 07:50.939
Master ordered you to take down the Su family,

07:51.070 --> 07:53.446
but you helped them make a big fortune.

07:53.470 --> 07:54.920
Don't worry.

07:55.250 --> 07:57.170
I'll explain it to Master.

07:57.190 --> 07:58.006
Yun Xiang.

07:58.030 --> 08:00.086
If we join hands again in the future,

08:00.110 --> 08:01.576
I hope you can be honest with me,

08:01.600 --> 08:03.080
so I won't make assumptions.

08:22.150 --> 08:23.750
Transforming Palms.

08:24.230 --> 08:25.646
Correct.

08:25.670 --> 08:29.476
You're so young but have mastered

08:29.500 --> 08:31.660
such an evil skill.

08:32.590 --> 08:34.446
What can Transforming Palms do?

08:34.470 --> 08:35.876
Transform.

08:35.900 --> 08:38.775
They transform your opponent's power into yours.

08:38.799 --> 08:40.696
So the punch Qi Tianfeng threw just now

08:40.720 --> 08:42.800
ended up landing on himself.

08:43.230 --> 08:45.110
So Kang Qiao is invincible?

08:45.280 --> 08:47.960
One may beat him with weapons with sharp edges.

08:48.070 --> 08:49.446
Kang Qiao is lucky.

08:49.470 --> 08:52.070
Qi Tianfeng fights with bare hands too.

08:54.020 --> 08:55.470
Back off.

08:57.350 --> 08:59.230
I'll tackle him myself.

09:08.400 --> 09:10.680
If I exert all my strength,

09:12.220 --> 09:14.630
can you still transform it into yours?

09:14.860 --> 09:16.430
Let's find out.

09:40.980 --> 09:43.440
Shadowmen, attack!

10:07.640 --> 10:09.090
Kang Qiao!

10:10.020 --> 10:11.470
Kang Qiao!

10:12.550 --> 10:14.120
K-Kang Qiao!

11:31.860 --> 11:33.540
Sister, help me!

11:35.870 --> 11:36.606
Young Master.

11:36.630 --> 11:38.230
Your clothes are dry.

12:08.750 --> 12:10.200
Young Master.

12:13.750 --> 12:14.230
Young Master.

12:14.230 --> 12:16.110
The bloodstain won't wash off.

12:57.190 --> 12:59.220
Don't worry, Mr. Mo.

12:59.510 --> 13:01.186
Kang Qiao was protected by his internal force.

13:01.210 --> 13:02.930
The power of that blow was greatly decreased.

13:03.230 --> 13:06.430
He just needs some time for the broken bones to heal.

13:06.870 --> 13:08.320
By the way,

13:09.640 --> 13:11.170
here is a secret medicine.

13:11.350 --> 13:13.350
It's a miracle cure for broken bones.

13:14.880 --> 13:16.810
You're not the one who's in pain.

13:19.510 --> 13:21.090
Here, drink it.

13:23.070 --> 13:24.326
No.

13:24.350 --> 13:26.350
It'll disperse my internal force.

13:27.350 --> 13:29.046
Drink it and have a good rest.

13:29.070 --> 13:30.686
Your internal force will come back soon.

13:30.710 --> 13:32.160
No.

13:32.470 --> 13:34.150
Without my internal force,

13:34.300 --> 13:37.086
how can I fight Qi Tianfeng if he comes back?

13:37.110 --> 13:38.206
Just drink it.

13:38.230 --> 13:40.090
I'll take care of the rest.

13:44.070 --> 13:47.006
I didn't raise you to be so reckless.

13:47.030 --> 13:49.046
All you do is get in fights.

13:49.070 --> 13:50.700
You're so combative.

13:53.720 --> 13:55.170
Mo.

13:55.430 --> 13:56.566
Sorry to make you worry.

13:56.590 --> 13:59.350
What should I do if something happens to you?

13:59.680 --> 14:02.360
I don't want to bury you!

14:05.230 --> 14:07.230
Mr. Mo, I've got news.

14:08.870 --> 14:09.846
Mr. Mo.

14:09.870 --> 14:11.026
Leave Kang Qiao to rest.

14:11.050 --> 14:12.500
Let's talk outside.

14:17.950 --> 14:20.166
Qi Tianfeng fled to one of the Cao Sect's docks

14:20.190 --> 14:21.686
and is hiding in a boat.

14:21.710 --> 14:23.056
He was stumbling,

14:23.080 --> 14:24.800
so he must have been badly injured.

14:27.870 --> 14:29.760
He didn't return to the base.

14:30.140 --> 14:32.060
Looks like he's planning to run away.

14:32.480 --> 14:33.566
When I came back,

14:33.590 --> 14:35.926
I saw Ding Yi heading to the dock with a bunch of people.

14:35.950 --> 14:37.750
They are all Qi Tianfeng's trusted aides.

14:37.930 --> 14:38.806
Keep a close eye on them.

14:38.830 --> 14:40.406
Report to me immediately if anything happens.

14:40.430 --> 14:41.880
Yes.

14:50.040 --> 14:51.770
Sorry for what happened to Kang Qiao.

14:52.780 --> 14:55.030
I'll go back and find more medicines

14:55.700 --> 14:57.670
that can help him recover sooner.

15:00.710 --> 15:03.100
Qi Tianfeng is at the end of his rope.

15:03.350 --> 15:05.590
You don't need to do anything now.

15:05.590 --> 15:07.110
I'll take over from here.

15:08.470 --> 15:09.686
Of course.

15:09.710 --> 15:11.506
You'd better not cause me more trouble.

15:11.530 --> 15:13.686
Kang Qiao can't get injured again.

15:13.710 --> 15:15.360
It'd be too much for him.

15:16.310 --> 15:18.656
Listen. You should thank god

15:18.680 --> 15:21.290
that the Iron Hand Demon didn't give him a critical hit today.

15:21.660 --> 15:23.206
Or you wouldn't be standing here

15:23.230 --> 15:24.990
and chatting with me now.

15:29.280 --> 15:31.190
It seems that you and Kang Qiao

15:31.440 --> 15:35.200
have a deep connection.

15:38.060 --> 15:39.840
Is there a story?

15:41.230 --> 15:42.950
It's none of your business.

15:44.310 --> 15:45.536
Wait.

15:45.560 --> 15:47.206
You just said

15:47.230 --> 15:48.806
we need to be honest with each other

15:48.830 --> 15:50.420
if we want to work together again.

16:00.110 --> 16:02.110
Kang Qiao was an orphan.

16:02.630 --> 16:05.206
I pitied him and adopted him.

16:05.230 --> 16:08.420
I later found that he was kind and honest,

16:10.410 --> 16:12.626
so I sent him to study in Yuntai Sect.

16:12.650 --> 16:14.326
He was so talented

16:14.350 --> 16:15.870
that the old weirdo Zhong Beidou

16:15.870 --> 16:16.680
noticed him

16:16.700 --> 16:18.940
and insisted on taking him as his last disciple.

16:20.670 --> 16:22.406
Since Kang Qiao was in Yanwu Master's good graces,

16:22.430 --> 16:24.330
he should've stayed at our headquarters.

16:24.470 --> 16:25.896
Yeah.

16:25.920 --> 16:27.536
But Kang Qiao didn't want to.

16:27.560 --> 16:29.636
Five years later, he insisted on coming back

16:29.660 --> 16:31.116
and has stuck around since then.

16:31.140 --> 16:33.420
That old weirdo was so mad.

16:35.830 --> 16:38.876
He went through lots of hardships

16:38.900 --> 16:41.100
but still has a kind and pure heart.

16:41.740 --> 16:43.356
You're lucky to have him

16:43.380 --> 16:44.486
as your right-hand man.

16:44.510 --> 16:46.240
My right-hand man?

16:47.030 --> 16:49.430
I've long regarded him as my son.

17:00.070 --> 17:01.970
What? Don't tell me

17:01.990 --> 17:02.996
you're to remind me that the sect rules

17:03.020 --> 17:05.260
forbid us from forming bonds with others.

17:05.509 --> 17:07.126
We indeed have such rules.

17:07.150 --> 17:08.435
Nonsense.

17:08.459 --> 17:09.506
We're human.

17:09.530 --> 17:10.955
We have feelings.

17:10.979 --> 17:12.695
These feelings are real.

17:12.719 --> 17:14.026
If one doesn't care for the people around him,

17:14.050 --> 17:15.170
how can we count on him to save the world?

17:15.190 --> 17:16.246
Mr. Mo.

17:16.270 --> 17:18.195
Careful. The walls have ears.

17:18.219 --> 17:20.109
You have ears.

17:22.670 --> 17:24.120
You're right.

17:24.509 --> 17:26.859
Thank you for your trust.

17:28.040 --> 17:29.886
I'm willing to tell you so much

17:29.910 --> 17:32.076
because you had the guts to disobey Master

17:32.100 --> 17:33.126
and let the Su family go.

17:33.150 --> 17:34.386
I think we're the same.

17:34.410 --> 17:36.640
We don't follow rules.

17:36.910 --> 17:38.136
Now it's your turn.

17:38.160 --> 17:40.316
Be honest with me.

17:40.340 --> 17:41.790
Tell me about you.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.470
Actually, my story

17:47.830 --> 17:49.870
is similar to Kang Qiao's.

17:54.910 --> 17:56.710
That's all you can tell me?

18:00.450 --> 18:01.916
Mr. Wen saved my life.

18:01.940 --> 18:03.436
So Mr. Wen is as important to me

18:03.460 --> 18:05.850
as you're to Kang Qiao.

18:07.750 --> 18:09.620
What happened to you?

18:12.270 --> 18:13.720
To tell you the truth,

18:14.920 --> 18:16.520
my whole family was killed.

18:20.740 --> 18:22.536
Mr. Wen told me repeatedly

18:22.560 --> 18:24.926
that I can't mention my past to anyone.

18:24.950 --> 18:28.110
So you're the only one in the sect who knows about it.

18:28.590 --> 18:30.240
Master doesn't know either?

18:35.930 --> 18:39.076
You've been studying in the sect for 15 years.

18:39.100 --> 18:42.790
The family that was killed 15 years ago…

18:45.870 --> 18:47.510
You're from the Luo family's village?

18:48.720 --> 18:50.270
You know about that massacre?

18:51.480 --> 18:53.526
The massacre in the Luo family's village was a sensation.

18:53.550 --> 18:55.680
Everyone in Nandu knew about it.

18:55.870 --> 18:57.190
But don't ask me for details.

18:57.190 --> 18:58.136
I don't know any.

18:58.160 --> 18:59.166
I told you

18:59.190 --> 19:00.476
I'm not close to Wen Cong.

19:00.500 --> 19:02.230
I know nothing.

19:06.870 --> 19:08.256
Fine.

19:08.280 --> 19:09.836
Then please

19:09.860 --> 19:11.720
keep this secret for me.

19:14.250 --> 19:16.070
It makes sense now.

19:17.190 --> 19:19.086
You raised a lot of dust

19:19.110 --> 19:21.236
with one scheme after another

19:21.260 --> 19:23.366
not only to avenge Wen Cong

19:23.390 --> 19:24.590
but also to find out

19:24.590 --> 19:27.260
the truth about the massacre.

19:28.110 --> 19:29.606
I knew it.

19:29.630 --> 19:30.526
It's impossible for anyone

19:30.550 --> 19:32.376
to have no feelings at all.

19:32.400 --> 19:34.526
You're Master's direct disciple,

19:34.550 --> 19:36.630
but you feel hatred just like everyone else does.

19:40.250 --> 19:41.700
Mr. Mo,

19:42.510 --> 19:45.630
I told you about my past

19:45.660 --> 19:47.136
because I'm sure

19:47.160 --> 19:49.696
that I'll need your help in the future.

19:49.720 --> 19:51.046
Wait.

19:51.070 --> 19:53.360
Did I just cause problems for myself?

19:53.670 --> 19:54.946
I won't let you

19:54.970 --> 19:56.580
help me for nothing.

19:56.740 --> 19:58.190
Really?

20:00.380 --> 20:02.156
Check carefully.

20:02.180 --> 20:04.156
All assets must be recorded.

20:04.180 --> 20:06.020
Don't miss anything.

20:15.790 --> 20:17.390
Mr. Tang.

20:17.820 --> 20:19.270
Mr. Mo.

20:20.510 --> 20:23.646
What a rare visitor to the Cao Sect.

20:23.670 --> 20:26.390
I'll be a regular here in the future.

20:26.670 --> 20:28.390
What brought you here, Mr. Tang?

20:28.560 --> 20:31.020
Who are you to ask that?

20:32.860 --> 20:34.310
Where is Mr. Qi?

20:34.420 --> 20:35.870
He ran away.

20:36.110 --> 20:37.906
If I'm not mistaken,

20:37.930 --> 20:39.616
you're here to collect

20:39.640 --> 20:40.846
the large sum of money

20:40.870 --> 20:42.510
you lent to Qi Tianfeng, right?

20:42.630 --> 20:44.950
It's a long story.

20:46.490 --> 20:49.100
I'll just grab a few valuable things to cut my losses.

20:49.210 --> 20:50.566
Be careful.

20:50.590 --> 20:53.246
Everything inside is mine.

20:53.270 --> 20:54.806
You'll have to pay if you break anything.

20:54.830 --> 20:56.280
What do you mean?

20:57.510 --> 20:58.960
Mr. Tang, come here.

21:02.360 --> 21:04.646
All the Cao Sect's assets

21:02.650 --> 21:05.110
[Deed]

21:04.670 --> 21:06.750
belong to my Guanghui Bank now.

21:08.070 --> 21:09.876
Mo Bufan.

21:09.900 --> 21:11.786
Don't be so conceited.

21:11.810 --> 21:14.460
You're getting carried away.

21:17.190 --> 21:18.486
Mr. Tang,

21:18.510 --> 21:20.950
don't be exasperated.

21:22.310 --> 21:24.416
I'm not exasperated.

21:24.440 --> 21:27.806
I heard that Mr. Qi became a total failure

21:27.830 --> 21:31.190
all thanks to Mr. Yun's

21:31.190 --> 21:34.086
ingenious strategies.

21:34.110 --> 21:35.126
What?

21:35.150 --> 21:40.176
Has Guanghui Bank colluded with him?

21:40.200 --> 21:41.650
Mr. Tang.

21:41.880 --> 21:43.766
It's just about business.

21:43.790 --> 21:47.030
Collude is not the right way to put it.

21:47.530 --> 21:48.926
You have a point.

21:48.950 --> 21:50.470
You have a point.

21:50.920 --> 21:52.370
How about Mr. Qi?

21:52.560 --> 21:55.396
Is he dead?

21:55.420 --> 21:57.740
Do you wish he were dead?

22:01.870 --> 22:03.370
What a funny question.

22:04.510 --> 22:05.960
[Cao Sect]

22:08.590 --> 22:11.750
You guys must find Qi Tianfeng.

22:15.130 --> 22:18.250
Some dirty hands have gotten on the Cao Sect.

22:18.510 --> 22:22.110
We need to wipe it clean.

22:22.590 --> 22:23.726
Understood.

22:23.750 --> 22:25.200
Let's go.

22:29.760 --> 22:33.680
[East of town, Qi Tianfeng's old house]

22:44.920 --> 22:46.370
Master Qi.

22:51.330 --> 22:53.216
You've gotten internal injuries.

22:53.240 --> 22:54.960
You need to take a good rest.

22:55.550 --> 22:58.230
I underestimated Kang Qiao.

22:59.230 --> 23:01.770
I didn't expect so young a man

23:02.110 --> 23:04.350
to be a master of martial arts.

23:05.830 --> 23:07.690
Mo Bufan is so conniving.

23:08.880 --> 23:11.930
He laid low when we dealt with Weng Cong.

23:12.660 --> 23:14.840
Who'd have known he's from Yuntai Sect?

23:15.690 --> 23:17.160
Yeah.

23:18.180 --> 23:22.900
[Liansheng House]

23:26.150 --> 23:27.376
Jin, be careful.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.846
Don't worry.

23:28.870 --> 23:30.410
Be careful with the table.

23:34.640 --> 23:36.450
Don't scratch the tables.

23:38.110 --> 23:40.286
The old furniture is fine.

23:40.310 --> 23:41.936
Why did Mr. Yun dump all of them

23:41.960 --> 23:43.440
and buy new ones?

23:43.550 --> 23:45.916
Liansheng House has been closed for too long.

23:45.940 --> 23:47.560
It's long been forgotten.

23:48.190 --> 23:50.466
Besides, most gambling houses in Nandu

23:50.490 --> 23:52.086
are under Tang Xiao's name.

23:52.110 --> 23:54.016
If we want to be successful,

23:54.040 --> 23:55.720
we have to be creative.

23:57.240 --> 23:59.680
But what purpose can these new tables serve?

24:00.020 --> 24:01.406
These tables are smaller.

24:01.430 --> 24:02.356
And,

24:02.380 --> 24:03.980
the bets are smaller too.

24:05.590 --> 24:08.206
The guest rooms upstairs

24:08.230 --> 24:09.606
will be replaced by joined beds.

24:09.630 --> 24:11.030
Guests from different places

24:11.030 --> 24:12.590
can sleep over for free.

24:14.030 --> 24:15.446
I see.

24:15.470 --> 24:17.286
We can't compete with the Tang family for rich gamblers

24:17.310 --> 24:19.886
so we'll start with small wagers they think little of.

24:19.910 --> 24:20.976
Bit by bit,

24:21.000 --> 24:22.610
we'll be popular again.

24:22.880 --> 24:24.330
Smart.

24:24.590 --> 24:26.956
We take what is dumped

24:26.980 --> 24:28.800
and offer what is needed.

24:28.970 --> 24:31.486
Mr. Yun brushed us off.

24:31.510 --> 24:33.070
I thought he didn't care about

24:33.070 --> 24:34.680
Liansheng House.

24:35.550 --> 24:37.746
I'm afraid he's up to something else

24:37.770 --> 24:39.510
and we just don't know about it.

24:48.190 --> 24:52.496
Well, we haven't made a penny

24:52.520 --> 24:55.920
but already spent a lot on the furniture.

24:59.830 --> 25:01.156
It's fine.

25:01.180 --> 25:03.496
If we do a remodel in the future,

25:03.520 --> 25:06.850
these tables can be used as desks for the children.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.560
Children?

25:09.590 --> 25:11.040
Whose children?

25:12.310 --> 25:14.340
Did You forget what Mr. Yun promised you?

25:16.240 --> 25:17.876
Yun Xiang mentioned those children to you?

25:17.900 --> 25:19.710
Is he really going to help me find them back?

25:25.260 --> 25:28.860
He's taken it seriously.

25:30.030 --> 25:31.830
He's changed.

25:58.730 --> 26:00.400
What are you thinking about?

26:00.680 --> 26:02.130
I'm thinking about you.

26:04.150 --> 26:05.600
I don't believe that.

26:08.940 --> 26:10.460
Let me look at you.

26:24.110 --> 26:25.850
You look much better.

26:26.160 --> 26:27.006
Really?

26:27.030 --> 26:28.480
Yes.

26:36.030 --> 26:37.156
Now that you've had enough rest,

26:37.180 --> 26:39.360
maybe you should start looking for Qi Tianfeng.

26:41.670 --> 26:44.616
He has nothing now.

26:44.640 --> 26:46.620
This is your best chance to take revenge on him.

26:47.230 --> 26:48.846
I'm not in a hurry.

26:48.870 --> 26:50.870
I know you'll need him

26:50.870 --> 26:52.526
to find out what happened in the Luo family's village.

26:52.550 --> 26:54.160
You won't let him escape.

26:56.110 --> 26:57.436
Why don't you tell me more

26:57.460 --> 26:59.020
about that incident in the Luo family's village?

26:59.110 --> 27:00.566
So I won't kill Qi Tianfeng

27:00.590 --> 27:02.656
the second I see him.

27:02.680 --> 27:04.130
You won't do that.

27:05.870 --> 27:08.790
You've become much less reckless recently.

27:10.590 --> 27:12.480
But you're still the same.

27:17.610 --> 27:20.126
If I changed for the better too,

27:20.150 --> 27:22.630
would we be together forever?

27:28.420 --> 27:29.920
Alright. Let's get down to business.

27:30.440 --> 27:31.536
Have you already found

27:31.560 --> 27:33.150
where Qi Tianfeng is?

27:38.530 --> 27:40.110
There's a dock

27:40.260 --> 27:42.846
20 miles east of town.

27:42.870 --> 27:44.186
It was abandoned years ago.

27:44.210 --> 27:45.986
There is a deserted house

27:46.010 --> 27:47.966
near that dock.

27:47.990 --> 27:51.016
It's said to be Qi Tianfeng's first property

27:51.040 --> 27:52.246
when he started from scratch.

27:52.270 --> 27:53.696
He's hiding there.

27:53.720 --> 27:55.640
20 miles? So close?

27:55.830 --> 27:58.086
Maybe he was injured by Kang Qiao and couldn't travel very far.

27:58.110 --> 27:59.406
He may escape again.

27:59.430 --> 28:00.446
I'll go with Ten Taels of Gold

28:00.470 --> 28:01.406
to bring him back right away.

28:01.430 --> 28:02.880
Wait.

28:03.310 --> 28:04.166
He's desperate now.

28:04.190 --> 28:05.536
We must not underestimate him.

28:05.560 --> 28:07.960
I can't let just you and Ten Taels of Gold go there.

28:09.030 --> 28:11.430
If that guy from the Su family could join you,

28:11.550 --> 28:13.450
I'd have nothing to worry about.

28:15.460 --> 28:16.910
Mr. Yun.

28:18.990 --> 28:19.846
Mr. Yun.

28:19.870 --> 28:20.806
Chairman Su is here.

28:20.830 --> 28:22.570
He wants to see you and Miss Shu.

28:31.110 --> 28:32.560
Mr. Qian.

28:33.150 --> 28:34.326
Go.

28:34.350 --> 28:35.800
Okay.

28:37.470 --> 28:39.016
Is Warrior Jin in Liansheng House?

28:39.040 --> 28:39.876
Yes.

28:39.900 --> 28:41.350
This way, please.

28:52.350 --> 28:55.060
Mr. Yun appears cold-hearted,

28:55.720 --> 28:57.386
but after the dust settled,

28:57.410 --> 29:00.066
it turned out

29:00.090 --> 29:02.476
that he pretended not to care

29:02.500 --> 29:04.250
but has arranged everything for us.

29:05.110 --> 29:08.130
He set us up and helped us out.

29:08.750 --> 29:11.330
Don't be fooled by him so easily.

29:12.490 --> 29:14.420
Like you were?

29:15.910 --> 29:17.370
You little brat.

29:20.550 --> 29:22.000
Mr. Qian.

29:22.140 --> 29:23.590
Mr. Qian.

29:24.310 --> 29:25.760
Hello, everyone.

29:26.510 --> 29:29.760
Liansheng House is ready to open.

29:30.230 --> 29:31.366
Yes.

29:31.390 --> 29:34.140
Are you here to get your money?

29:35.590 --> 29:37.926
Gold is heavy,

29:37.950 --> 29:40.720
so I took a few banknotes.

29:40.880 --> 29:43.126
If there's anything improper,

29:43.150 --> 29:44.286
please let me know.

29:44.310 --> 29:46.676
It's fine.

29:46.700 --> 29:47.326
Banknotes are more convenient.

29:47.350 --> 29:48.800
Thank you.

29:51.070 --> 29:52.520
Miss Meng Lan,

29:52.900 --> 29:54.350
I need to ask you about something.

29:54.590 --> 29:57.670
What did you say to Mr. Su at the back door

29:58.000 --> 29:59.600
of Su's Residence the day before yesterday?

30:03.180 --> 30:05.300
Sorry. I presumed too much.

30:05.590 --> 30:07.706
I shouldn't have come over uninvited.

30:07.730 --> 30:09.916
Don't get me wrong. That's not what I mean.

30:09.940 --> 30:11.496
I just want to know

30:11.520 --> 30:14.480
whether there was anything off with Mr. Su that day.

30:14.890 --> 30:17.380
He seemed a bit distracted.

30:17.450 --> 30:19.106
I thought he was tired from the journey.

30:19.130 --> 30:20.650
He didn't say anything special.

30:20.830 --> 30:23.886
He would rather feel sad himself

30:23.910 --> 30:26.110
than make you worry.

30:27.330 --> 30:29.330
Is Mr. Su all right?

30:30.390 --> 30:31.840
What?

30:32.310 --> 30:34.910
He hasn't gathered himself yet?

30:36.910 --> 30:39.366
Warrior Jin, you're used to bloodshed,

30:39.390 --> 30:41.560
but Mr. Su had never seen that before.

30:42.070 --> 30:46.086
After he came back, he couldn't eat

30:46.110 --> 30:47.560
and couldn't sleep.

30:48.300 --> 30:49.806
It's just killing someone

30:49.830 --> 30:51.246
and getting some blood on his hands.

30:51.270 --> 30:52.720
How about this?

30:53.230 --> 30:54.406
I'll talk to him.

30:54.430 --> 30:56.676
You paid me double.

30:56.700 --> 30:58.306
I have to do something.

30:58.330 --> 31:00.436
Both I and Miss Su

31:00.460 --> 31:03.260
prefer someone else to do it.

31:10.570 --> 31:12.270
Can I go now?

31:13.310 --> 31:13.846
Of course.

31:13.870 --> 31:15.510
The sooner, the better.

31:16.150 --> 31:17.790
Thank you, Mr. Qian.

31:17.830 --> 31:19.310
By the way, Miss,

31:19.430 --> 31:20.326
Miss Su said

31:20.350 --> 31:23.590
this time you'll walk in through the front door.

31:26.630 --> 31:27.726
Thank you, Mr. Qian.

31:27.750 --> 31:29.200
Go now.

31:32.450 --> 31:33.786
Chairman Su, I guess you're here

31:33.810 --> 31:36.310
to ask about Qi Tianfeng's whereabouts, right?

31:37.790 --> 31:40.750
He's out of his depth now. I'm in no rush to go after him.

31:41.590 --> 31:43.390
Then what else can I do for you?

31:45.490 --> 31:48.560
I've been interested in business since I was young.

31:48.930 --> 31:50.956
The strategies you used this time

31:50.980 --> 31:52.690
impressed me greatly.

31:53.310 --> 31:55.246
I've been trying to put the pieces together.

31:55.270 --> 31:58.030
May I ask you a few questions?

31:59.680 --> 32:02.000
I'm sure you've long

32:02.030 --> 32:04.550
seen through my little tricks.

32:05.590 --> 32:07.040
You flatter me.

32:08.530 --> 32:11.780
It looked like the Su family was cornered by Qi Tianfeng,

32:12.270 --> 32:18.670
but I think it's just a plot of yours

32:19.370 --> 32:22.120
to lure him into the trap.

32:27.410 --> 32:30.606
The rise of silk price was indeed a big problem.

32:30.630 --> 32:33.636
I could've been voted out as the chairwoman.

32:33.660 --> 32:34.626
Things could get worse.

32:34.650 --> 32:36.806
The Su family might not be able to submit the tribute cloth

32:36.830 --> 32:38.590
and lose His Majesty's rewards.

32:38.950 --> 32:40.720
No matter what,

32:40.860 --> 32:43.250
losses were inevitable

32:43.310 --> 32:45.710
but the Su family could surely survive.

32:51.150 --> 32:54.430
However, we heeded your advice

32:55.750 --> 32:57.540
and sold the deeds.

32:58.550 --> 33:00.626
That was when we put the future

33:00.650 --> 33:02.660
of the Su family at stake.

33:09.030 --> 33:11.126
After Qi Tianfeng knew about it,

33:11.150 --> 33:12.326
he rolled the dice

33:12.350 --> 33:15.566
and bought lots of raw silk deeds.

33:15.590 --> 33:17.246
As a result, the price was raised.

33:17.270 --> 33:21.990
Only one of the Cao Sect and the Su family could survive.

33:24.670 --> 33:27.830
Qi Tianfeng easily goes to extremes.

33:28.130 --> 33:30.066
I knew it would work for him

33:30.090 --> 33:33.210
and I didn't have better options.

33:35.070 --> 33:38.230
Fortunately, we won.

33:39.270 --> 33:40.770
So let's put it behind us.

33:40.980 --> 33:43.260
But there's one thing I don't understand.

33:45.110 --> 33:47.470
Now that we're the winners,

33:47.590 --> 33:50.910
why don't you just let it go?

33:53.590 --> 33:56.406
It's not easy to take the Su family down.

33:56.430 --> 33:58.726
No matter how ambitious Qi Tianfeng was,

33:58.750 --> 34:01.086
he needed to gain the upper hand to succeed.

34:01.110 --> 34:01.670
What gave him the upper hand

34:01.670 --> 34:04.406
was the fire in Yufeng Warehouse.

34:04.430 --> 34:06.556
I thought since Qi Tianfeng

34:06.580 --> 34:08.656
benefited the most from that fire,

34:08.680 --> 34:12.019
he should be the one who set the fire.

34:12.750 --> 34:15.650
Are you implying that someone else did it?

34:17.420 --> 34:19.019
I don't have evidence.

34:19.470 --> 34:21.716
But after you capture Qi Tianfeng,

34:21.740 --> 34:24.820
please do me a favor and ask him about it.

34:26.069 --> 34:27.519
Of course.

34:29.750 --> 34:31.200
Miss Shu.

34:33.000 --> 34:35.030
Your wish has been fulfilled.

34:37.339 --> 34:40.806
I returned the compensation from the four Armed Escort Agencies

34:40.830 --> 34:42.470
and paid 20,000 taels of silver

34:42.470 --> 34:44.590
to the escorts' families.

34:45.350 --> 34:46.860
It's very kind of you, Chairman Su.

34:48.620 --> 34:50.840
I merely did what I promised.

34:50.900 --> 34:53.275
Miss Su, you almost

34:53.299 --> 34:55.686
lost your life this time

34:55.710 --> 34:58.286
and gave all the escort fee

34:58.310 --> 35:00.150
to those escorts.

35:00.620 --> 35:02.750
You're so much kinder than me.

35:03.080 --> 35:06.516
I know you did that just because you have a warm heart,

35:06.540 --> 35:08.326
but others may think

35:08.350 --> 35:10.526
you showed sympathy

35:10.550 --> 35:12.470
because you experienced

35:12.830 --> 35:16.390
something no one knows about.

35:27.640 --> 35:29.526
Don't make innuendos.

35:29.550 --> 35:31.100
Just get to the point.

35:47.430 --> 35:49.320
If Qian Rong tries to kill me,

35:49.750 --> 35:51.250
don't fight him.

35:51.870 --> 35:53.900
I don't want you to die for nothing.

35:55.080 --> 35:56.450
Have you heard of

35:56.470 --> 35:58.300
Shu's Armed Escort Agency?

35:59.610 --> 36:02.816
It used to be the most famous Armed Escort Agency in Nandu.

36:02.840 --> 36:05.206
Then you should know what happened to the Shu family.

36:05.230 --> 36:06.126
You should also understand

36:06.150 --> 36:08.510
why I treat the dead and wounded escorts so well.

36:09.710 --> 36:10.886
Yanan,

36:10.910 --> 36:13.930
don't be rude.

36:16.670 --> 36:20.516
So, you're the only one left of the Shu family.

36:20.540 --> 36:23.486
If I said anything that offended you,

36:23.510 --> 36:24.960
please forgive me.

36:40.990 --> 36:42.440
Chairman Su.

36:42.590 --> 36:44.380
She's been through a lot

36:44.540 --> 36:46.326
and only survived thanks to her fierce personality.

36:46.350 --> 36:48.190
Please don't take it to heart.

36:48.690 --> 36:49.986
Mr. Yun,

36:50.010 --> 36:51.490
I came today to thank you.

36:51.860 --> 36:53.700
I didn't mean for that to happen.

36:56.210 --> 36:57.760
I can't win this game

36:57.790 --> 37:00.350
even if we play until it's dark.

37:00.550 --> 37:02.876
Beat the drum and pass the flower.

37:02.900 --> 37:05.276
Guess how many pine nuts are in the fist.

37:05.300 --> 37:06.886
What's so hard about this simple game?

37:06.910 --> 37:08.146
Fill the glass.

37:08.170 --> 37:09.046
I'll show you how to win.

37:09.070 --> 37:10.520
Great.

37:12.970 --> 37:14.420
Girl.

37:15.280 --> 37:16.730
Is she crazy?

37:24.310 --> 37:25.586
Rong,

37:25.610 --> 37:27.380
do you think what Shu Yanan said

37:27.400 --> 37:28.850
is the truth?

37:31.030 --> 37:32.480
I'm not sure.

37:33.310 --> 37:34.596
But if Shu Yanan

37:34.620 --> 37:36.710
really were an orphan of the Shu family,

37:37.540 --> 37:39.276
it would explain

37:39.300 --> 37:40.870
why she helped those escorts.

37:41.450 --> 37:44.080
If that were the case,

37:44.310 --> 37:46.070
it'd be very likely

37:46.650 --> 37:48.246
that she set the fire in Yufeng Warehouse.

37:48.270 --> 37:51.400
Shu's Armed Escort Agency was destroyed by Qi Tianfeng.

37:51.490 --> 37:54.366
Yun Xiang may have told her

37:54.390 --> 37:56.796
that by burning down Yufeng Warehouse,

37:56.820 --> 37:58.900
she could avenge her family's deaths.

37:59.500 --> 38:02.950
That would give her enough reason

38:03.270 --> 38:05.076
to do something even more terrible.

38:05.100 --> 38:07.090
This matter is complicated.

38:07.870 --> 38:09.660
To avoid future troubles,

38:10.810 --> 38:14.156
why don't we find a chance to capture Shu Yanan?

38:14.180 --> 38:15.630
No need.

38:15.730 --> 38:19.610
I made myself very clear just now.

38:19.830 --> 38:22.620
Yun Xiang used us this time,

38:22.660 --> 38:23.570
but we got the profits

38:23.590 --> 38:25.336
we deserve.

38:25.360 --> 38:27.320
So it's time

38:27.470 --> 38:28.920
to put the whole thing to an end.

38:41.760 --> 38:43.880
Do you want to kill Qi Tianfeng?

38:51.880 --> 38:54.950
If you do, trust me.

38:55.590 --> 38:57.110
Don't ask anything.

39:10.330 --> 39:12.430
[Yufeng Warehouse]

40:10.690 --> 40:14.040
[Shu's Ancestral Hall]

40:40.000 --> 40:41.810
You did well just now.

40:46.140 --> 40:48.130
Su Huairou came here

40:48.590 --> 40:50.400
to let us know

40:50.650 --> 40:53.000
that she's not a pawn that we can manipulate.

40:54.120 --> 40:55.850
Given the circumstances,

40:56.150 --> 40:58.070
even if she knew the truth,

40:58.670 --> 41:00.330
she wouldn't pursue it.

41:00.940 --> 41:03.800
Do you think I'm afraid of being killed by Qian Rong?

41:06.710 --> 41:08.620
In the past, I only killed criminals

41:08.780 --> 41:10.710
and never hurt innocent people.

41:11.230 --> 41:12.636
I'll say it again.

41:12.660 --> 41:15.430
You didn't kill those escorts.

41:19.150 --> 41:20.906
Don't tell me to delude myself.

41:20.930 --> 41:22.600
You said that so easily

41:22.940 --> 41:25.016
just because you weren't there

41:25.040 --> 41:27.360
seeing swords going through their hearts.

41:28.150 --> 41:29.710
Their warm blood

41:30.150 --> 41:32.880
didn't splash on you.

41:33.080 --> 41:35.130
Because of the fire I set,

41:35.630 --> 41:38.200
they ended up dead in the wilderness.

41:38.710 --> 41:41.016
Many women lost their husbands.

41:41.040 --> 41:42.820
Many children lost their fathers.

41:45.020 --> 41:46.470
Calm down.

41:48.200 --> 41:49.650
Calm down!

41:54.280 --> 41:56.520
Haven't we made an agreement?

41:57.220 --> 41:58.930
You'll just carry out orders

41:58.990 --> 42:00.440
without asking any questions.

42:00.550 --> 42:01.856
So when you went to Yufeng Warehouse that day,

42:01.880 --> 42:03.466
you had no idea what would happen.

42:03.490 --> 42:04.836
But I'm different.

42:04.860 --> 42:07.030
I knew everything from the beginning.

42:11.320 --> 42:13.100
That's why I keep telling you

42:13.630 --> 42:15.890
Qi Tianfeng was the one who killed those escorts.

42:21.000 --> 42:23.110
I'm not just trying to comfort you.

42:23.790 --> 42:25.670
I'm also lying to myself.

42:32.870 --> 42:34.226
If one day,

42:34.250 --> 42:36.576
the ghosts of those escorts come back for revenge,

42:36.600 --> 42:38.450
they won't come at you.

42:40.820 --> 42:42.270
They'll come at me.

42:46.060 --> 42:47.630
I hope you understand

42:47.950 --> 42:49.350
that many innocent people

42:49.350 --> 42:51.590
were killed by Qi Tianfeng.

42:52.670 --> 42:55.286
If we hadn't taken this opportunity to get rid of him,

42:55.310 --> 42:55.966
yeah,

42:55.990 --> 42:58.350
those escorts wouldn't have died,

42:58.950 --> 43:00.726
but more innocent people

43:00.750 --> 43:02.830
would've been killed by that bastard.

43:06.790 --> 43:08.450
Do the lesser evil to eliminate the greater evil.

43:09.060 --> 43:11.170
Is that how the Yuntai Sect does justice?

43:18.580 --> 43:20.360
Before Su Huairou left,

43:21.150 --> 43:23.246
she said the four Armed Escort Agencies in Nandu

43:23.270 --> 43:26.320
are willing to take this chance to kill Qi Tianfeng.

43:26.970 --> 43:29.060
I've asked Ten Taels of Gold to contact them.

43:30.470 --> 43:31.920
But don't worry.

43:32.790 --> 43:34.240
This time,

43:34.830 --> 43:38.060
I'll kill him without a single drop of blood being shed.

43:41.680 --> 43:43.360
How can you be sure?

43:50.710 --> 43:52.340
I have my ways,

43:53.570 --> 43:55.400
or I wouldn't have given you my word.
